{"title":"The Crystal Skull","link":"https://kottke.org/26/04/the-crystal-skull","date":1776103200000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776102047-132196d5.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776102047-132196d5.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776102047-132196d5.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://www.davidaltmejd.net/2017/god-2017\">David Altmejd’s 2017 sculpture entitled “God”</a> is one of the most disturbing artworks I’ve seen recently, so naturally I had to show all of you. If you need further wigging out, <a href=\"https://www.davidaltmejd.net/2017/loeil-2017\">here</a> <a href=\"https://www.davidaltmejd.net/2015/eye-2015\">you</a> <a href=\"https://www.davidaltmejd.net/2019/crystal-system-2019\">go</a>. Lots more on his <a href=\"https://www.davidaltmejd.net/\">website</a> and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/daltmejd/\">Instagram</a>.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/David%20Altmejd\">David Altmejd</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"b1a68562a6c6ddf9fab2286d41f185fb87780ae4eb175a03729baf580426278c","category":"Sites"}